v0.3.6: every dynamic label now follows the language switch

- ui/app.js: add dynText/dynSet/dynRefresh registry; refreshDynamicLabels re-renders
  GDB connect line, version lines, About update status, register/memory/flash status
  lines, breakpoint/watchpoint counts and empty-state rows, and the status-bar target.
- ui/app.js: showVersion and checkUpdate build their text lazily (closure) so the
  language picked at boot no longer sticks to the first render.
- ui/index.html: About link labels dropped the project/own prefixes; the two cfg notes
  are gone (the preview line stays); status bar got a tb.targetNone key.
- ui/i18n.js: cfg.preview.note / cfg.order.note removed, tb.targetNone added; zh and en
  are both at 308 keys.